  "prompt": "Which customers with customer_id from 3001 to 3100 (both included) placed their latest order of January to June 2025 on the web? Take each such customer's latest order from 1 January to 30 June 2025 (order_ts holds UTC time; both days included, in UTC); when two orders of a customer tie on order_ts, the one with the lower order_id counts as the latest. A web order has channel 'web'. Return two columns, in this order: customer_id and order_id (the latest order). Return one row for each customer whose latest order was a web order. Any row order is fine.",
